Z||000013||Fformula88||07-23-2001||05:42 PM||||$24,000 for a Focus?!?!?  WTF!!  That is absolutely rediculous.  I don't care if it had a Contour SVT V6!  I still wouldn't give Ford that kind of money for one.<P>For that kind of money, you can be cruising in a Miata with the top down, blowing away from the Focus from the stoplight and in the twisties, and have lots of change left over for gas and dinner!||||reg||1
